nd fetched/advertised main b3422b05226253a17676b9b84c764071fe3dbe74. All 408 paginated hosted files and all 408 hosted blob SHAs match the exact local diff/tree. All three introduced commits (6e8a1988, 87451b53, 018c9d96) verify with Ivan Oparin / oparin@me.com signing key; original signed PR ancestry is unchanged.\\\\n\\\\nThe complete old-head-to-new-head delta is exactly the 16 accepted CI paths. Fourteen blobs, including the validation fixture, equal accepted immutable d6c873383db09c59cf5d6d437e0767615e5ae704. README and LOGBOOK retain every old line and every accepted addition. The fixture retains the prior dependency correction and adds only diagnostic runners relative to old PR. All other Shared Runtime bytes are unchanged; prior independent Shared Runtime review is reused, not represented as a fresh broad audit.\\\\n\\\\nPersonally reran from the exact clean delivery head: 32 board/scanner/diagnostic Python tests (exit 0); actual board CLI (412 elements, exit 0); PR boundary mutation harness (exit 0, three expected failing mutant children); diagnostics mutation harness (exit 0, three expected failing mutant children); composition diff whitespace check (exit 0). Swift SnapshotDiff baseline and HTTP-admission negative compile through the shipped scratch harness on macOS/Swift 6.3.2. No full Xcode/application build or Go suite rerun. This is not proof of normally assembled build artifacts.\\\\n\\\\nNegative coverage: board root-only exclusion via actual CLI; scanner arbitrary-URL admission via runtime scanner; SnapshotDiff.compare rejects four non-file schemes at three URL positions before I/O. validate-macos-targets.sh -> run_logged_command drives five build/test positions for each of statuses 1 and 65 (10/10 injected rows; 5/7 Xcode sites); two build-settings failure paths and arbitrary other statuses are not exhaustively tested. The\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 6337,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1585,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
