d LOGBOOKstash. Do not repeat product work or update reviewedhead unnecessarily.\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2965,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 742,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
