{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c879","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa6f-a3a8-7c72-bad2-76397b67d24d"},"sequence":663,"recorded_at":1780531400001321,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"b282fa7c-2a0d-4bf0-891b-945cd9ab9d24","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"b282fa7c-2a0d-4bf0-891b-945cd9ab9d24","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"b282fa7c-2a0d-4bf0-891b-945cd9ab9d24"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0aa72-3e0f-7ff3-9ba2-7afc7e7f9b3f"},"task_id":"01a0aa72-3e0f-7ff3-9ba2-7afc7e7f9b3f","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0aa72-3e0f-7ff3-9ba2-7afc7e7f9b3f","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-27-1\",\n  \"command\": \"git log --format='%H %s%n%b---END---' b3422b0..db89c1a 2>&1 | head -n 60\\necho \\\"===BUGS on board (integrating?)===\\\"\\ntask-board q 'list(type=bug, status=integrating) { id status }' 2>&1 | head -c 2000\",\n  \"description\": \"Get commit messages and integrating bugs\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"db89c1a555fd4cf57a1cba7fe7bf998f6951b1f2 fix(ci): align native Xcode toolchain selection\\nSelect the manifest-pinned Xcode build explicitly on macos-26 hosted runners instead of relying on the runner default, and cover the selection gate with executable workflow-command and narrowing-mutant tests.\\n\\nAccepted source: CR-BUG-260916-1rqn1c rev 3; staged tree verified as independently reviewed prospective tree 1c1ca7ad20e27e03f003cb3ea0bc466db45fe9e0 before commit.\\n---END---\\nd45c85d67b78b6578b5cb0821bd2e78217124d30 fix(harness): declare M1 host-owner probe as weak var\\n---END---\\n310a560916d8b8012fa238f65b51649041caee4d fix(macos): guard NWError.wifiAware mapping for older SDKs\\nCompile the wifiAware case only under compiler(>=6.2) so the mapper builds against SDKs without the macOS 26 enum member, and cover the current-SDK unavailable projection without platform values.\\n\\nAccepted source: CR-BUG-260916-20xt79 rev 2; staged tree verified as independently reviewed prospective tree b383baa86274d4ace8294b6a0f9ec1d45ddc6198 before commit.\\n---END---\\na46e2ba351a81e42f2907805b4cda2c313af7bd1 fix(runtime): require Sendable mapped result for Swift 6.1\\nConstrain TunnelRuntimeCoordinator.mapped to T: Sendable and cover all five mapped acquisitions with caller cancellation cases.\\n\\nAccepted source: CR-BUG-260908-shki8p rev 2; staged tree verified as independently reviewed prospective tree 45826b72e05e2accac7c7165691c8a1d1ecf701f before commit.\\n---END---\\n018c9d9672767fd02f42fb4ab4f2dfe3800646b8 fix(ci): compose accepted validation boundaries and macOS diagnostics\\n---END---\\n87451b53960ceabe88a01c44c287fee7f9ebf386 Record STORY-260715-1y04r0 board state\\n---END---\\n6e8a19885f99ec9837054e0b3e07e7d0c1ffcd51 STORY-260715-1y04r0: Shared tunnel runtime and extension-owned orchestration\\nChange-Request: CR-TASK-260830-1x524u-3 rev 3\\n---END---\\n===BUGS on board (integrating?)===\\n[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"BUG-260908-shki8p\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"integrating\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"BUG-260908-33iyb1\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"integrating\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"BUG-260908-7c5iv4\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"integrating\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"BUG-260916-1rqn1c\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"integrating\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"BUG-260916-2764p8\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"integrating\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"BUG-260916-20xt79\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"integrating\\\"}]\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2177,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 545,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
