{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cb65","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa6f-a3a8-7c72-bad2-76397b67d24d"},"sequence":1037,"recorded_at":1780531400002069,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"b282fa7c-2a0d-4bf0-891b-945cd9ab9d24","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"b282fa7c-2a0d-4bf0-891b-945cd9ab9d24","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"b282fa7c-2a0d-4bf0-891b-945cd9ab9d24"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0aa74-0e64-7c50-94f7-e93d98540912"},"task_id":"01a0aa74-0e64-7c50-94f7-e93d98540912","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0aa74-0e64-7c50-94f7-e93d98540912","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-41-1\",\n  \"command\": \"gh pr edit 6 --body \\\"Delivers the accepted Shared Tunnel Runtime Story: extension-owned orchestration, runtime composition, deterministic harnesses, migration boundaries, and supporting contracts. The macOS PacketTunnelProvider remains a lifecycle shell; this does not wire or activate a live system VPN.\\n\\nThe curator-managed integration of accepted CR-TASK-260830-1x524u-3 produced signed Story commit 6e8a19885f99ec9837054e0b3e07e7d0c1ffcd51 (tree 0ca11378213cc02a78eeac937f94aef6c5209545) and board-only commit 87451b53960ceabe88a01c44c287fee7f9ebf386. Both signatures verify for Ivan Oparin <oparin@me.com>. Original signed Story checkpoint 9bf4d0892db03035b989a4c040cfee37636ff8df is preserved.\\n\\nValidation: accepted rev3 independent review reran runtime harness, 11 focused Swift tests, scheme-contract negative tests and a killed narrowed-gate mutant. Same-tree full credential-free publisher and independent suites passed; 514 Swift tests and selected-scope 90.32% line coverage are recorded in attached board evidence. Delivery independently verified signed objects, exact accepted product tree, board-only second delta and clean product diff whitespace. Historical raw evidence logs contain whitespace diagnostics; they were preserved verbatim. Hosted checks and exact-head platform review remain required before remote main advances.\\n\\nDelivered scope (exact landed head db89c1a555fd4cf57a1cba7fe7bf998f6951b1f2, tree 1c1ca7ad20e27e03f003cb3ea0bc466db45fe9e0; all commits Ivan Oparin signed; hosted run 35098918403 7/7 success; review https://github.com/relux-works/relux-tunnel/pull/6#pullrequestreview-5223410566):\\n- TASK-260830-1x524u revalidate-shared-runtime-story-for-integration (CR rev 3 -> 6e8a198 + 87451b5)\\n- BUG-260908-33iyb1 diagnose-and-fix-pr6-macos-generated-build-failure (018c9d9 composition) with BUG-260908-7c5iv4 fix-pr6-activity-validation-and-snapshot-loader-scan checkpoint\\n- BUG-260908-shki8p prove-and-fix-hosted-macos-build-after-diagnostics (a46e2ba mapped<T: Sendable>)\\n- BUG-260916-20xt79 fix-nwerror-wifiaware-xcode16-sdk-compatibility (310a560)\\n- BUG-260916-2764p8 fix-swift61-m1-runtime-weak-capture-compilation (d45c85d)\\n- BUG-260916-1rqn1c align-ci-native-xcode-toolchain (db89c1a)\\\" 2>&1; echo \\\"edit exit:$?\\\"\\ngh pr view 6 --json headRefOid,state --jq '\\\"\\\\(.headRefOid) \\\\(.state)\\\"' 2>&1\",\n  \"description\": \"Add TASK ID to PR body\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"https://github.com/relux-works/relux-tunnel/pull/6\\nedit exit:0\\ndb89c1a555fd4cf57a1cba7fe7bf998f6951b1f2 MERGED\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 111,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 28,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
